 "description": "\n <ul>\n  <li>SLOWS EATING BY UP TO 10X FOR HEALTHIER DIGESTION: Fast eaters risk bloating and vomiting. Our maze-style design forces dogs to work for food, extending meal time and reducing gulping. Suitable for large breeds and dogs with eating disorders</li>\n  <li>2-IN-1 SLOW FEEDER &amp; LICK MAT FOR MENTAL STIMULATION: Double the fun! Use as a puzzle feeder with kibble or flip to use as a lick mat for wet food/treats. Keeps dogs mentally engaged, reduces boredom, and calms anxiety during meals or crate time</li>\n  <li>STURDY BPA-FREE PLASTIC WITH NON-SLIP BASE: Built to last with chew-resistant, food-safe plastic. The rubberized base grips floors securely to prevent tipping and spills. No loose parts-safe for puppies and aggressive chewers</li>\n  <li>FITS ALL BREEDS: Suitable for medium to large breeds, puppies, and even cats who enjoy puzzle feeders. A tool for better digestion, reduced anxiety, and stronger bonding during mealtime</li>\n  <li>EASY TO CLEAN &amp; DISHWASHER SAFE: Smooth, seamless surfaces rinse clean with soap and water or go in the dishwasher. Ready for daily use with kibble, wet food, or frozen treats<br><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/5f247cca-f036-4a30-ad89-5692570e6a7f.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/05058978-ee1d-4e70-bebe-503112334bce.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></li>\n </ul>\n",
